This repository adapts code and stated results from

  Structure and Interpretation of Computer Programs, second edition,
  by Harold Abelson and Gerald Jay Sussman, with Julie Sussman.
  MIT Press.

as published under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
International License (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/),
including the HTML edition at https://github.com/sarabander/sicp.

Changes: the book's code is split into one program per section, each
expression whose value the book states is wrapped so the program prints it,
and the definitions the book assumes from MIT Scheme come from SRFI 216
("SICP Prerequisites"). Where a section needs something the book leaves to
an exercise or to the reader, the program says so at that point.

